{"id":"a127428b-8cd2-4897-a611-40c93653e0d4","createdAt":"2026-10-26T12:44:46.808Z","batchId":"login_deepseek-v4-1-flash-togetherai-gateway_high","approach":"html","modelId":"deepseek-v4.1-flash-togetherai-gateway","settings":{"effort":"high"},"presetId":"login","prompt":"A login form with email, password, a \"remember me\" option and a sign-in button.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-lg\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:26rem\">\n\n    <header class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <div class=\"row center gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font-weight:700\">N</span>\n        <strong>Northwind</strong>\n      </div>\n      <h1>Sign in</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead muted\">Welcome back. Enter your details to access your workspace.</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <form id=\"login-form\" class=\"stack gap-lg\" novalidate>\n\n        <div id=\"form-alert\" class=\"alert alert-destructive\" hidden role=\"alert\"></div>\n\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <label for=\"email\">\n            Email address\n            <input\n              id=\"email\"\n              name=\"email\"\n              type=\"email\"\n              inputmode=\"email\"\n              autocomplete=\"username\"\n              placeholder=\"you@company.com\"\n              required\n              aria-describedby=\"email-help\">\n          </label>\n          <p id=\"email-help\" class=\"small muted\">Use the address your invite was sent to.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <label for=\"password\">\n            Password\n            <span class=\"pw-wrap\">\n              <input\n                id=\"password\"\n                name=\"password\"\n                type=\"password\"\n                autocomplete=\"current-password\"\n                placeholder=\"Enter your password\"\n                required\n                minlength=\"8\"\n                aria-describedby=\"password-help\">\n              <button\n                type=\"button\"\n                id=\"toggle-password\"\n                class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm pw-toggle\"\n                aria-controls=\"password\"\n                aria-pressed=\"false\">Show</button>\n            </span>\n          </label>\n          <p id=\"password-help\" class=\"small muted\">At least 8 characters.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"row between center gap-sm\">\n          <label class=\"check\">\n            <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"remember\" name=\"remember\" checked>\n            Remember me\n          </label>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"small\">Forgot password?</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <button type=\"submit\" id=\"submit-btn\" class=\"btn btn-block\">Sign in</button>\n          <p class=\"small muted\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n            Signed in on a shared device? Leave “Remember me” unchecked.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n      </form>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row center gap-sm small muted\">\n      <span>New to Northwind?</span>\n      <a href=\"#\">Create an account</a>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .pw-wrap { position: relative; display: block; }\n  .pw-wrap input { width: 100%; padding-right: 4.25rem; }\n  .pw-toggle {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 50%;\n    right: 0.35rem;\n    transform: translateY(-50%);\n  }\n  #login-form label > input { width: 100%; }\n</style>\n\n<script>\n  (function () {\n    var form = document.getElementById('login-form');\n    var email = document.getElementById('email');\n    var password = document.getElementById('password');\n    var toggle = document.getElementById('toggle-password');\n    var submit = document.getElementById('submit-btn');\n    var alertBox = document.getElementById('form-alert');\n\n    function showAlert(message) {\n      alertBox.textContent = message;\n      alertBox.hidden = false;\n    }\n\n    function clearAlert() {\n      alertBox.hidden = true;\n      alertBox.textContent = '';\n    }\n\n    toggle.addEventListener('click', function () {\n      var showing = password.type === 'text';\n      password.type = showing ? 'password' : 'text';\n      toggle.textContent = showing ? 'Show' : 'Hide';\n      toggle.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(!showing));\n      password.focus();\n    });\n\n    [email, password].forEach(function (field) {\n      field.addEventListener('input', clearAlert);\n    });\n\n    form.addEventListener('submit', function (event) {\n      event.preventDefault();\n      clearAlert();\n\n      if (!email.value.trim() || !password.value) {\n        showAlert('Enter both your email address and password to continue.');\n        (!email.value.trim() ? email : password).focus();\n        return;\n      }\n\n      if (!/^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$/.test(email.value.trim())) {\n        showAlert('That email address doesn’t look right. Check for typos and try again.');\n        email.focus();\n        return;\n      }\n\n      if (password.value.length < 8) {\n        showAlert('Passwords are at least 8 characters. Check your entry and try again.');\n        password.focus();\n        return;\n      }\n\n      submit.disabled = true;\n      submit.textContent = 'Signing in…';\n\n      window.setTimeout(function () {\n        submit.disabled = false;\n        submit.textContent = 'Sign in';\n        showAlert('Those credentials didn’t match an account. Try again or reset your password.');\n        password.value = '';\n        password.focus();\n      }, 900);\n    });\n  })();\n</script>","deltas":[[1947,"<div"],[1955," class=\"page\">\n  "],[1961,"<div class"],[1962,"=\"stack gap"],[1971,"-lg\" style=\"width:"],[1982,"100%;max-width:26"],[1982,"rem\">\n\n"],[1992,"    <header class=\"stack"],[2003," gap-sm"],[2014,"\">\n"],[2014,"      <div class=\"row"],[2024," center"],[2036," gap-sm\">\n"],[2036,"        <span class=\"avatar"],[2043,"\" aria"],[2053,"-hidden=\"true\" style"],[2053,"=\"font"],[2064,"-weight:700\">N"],[2083,"</span>\n        <strong"],[2084,">"],[2084,"Northwind"],[2093,"</strong>\n      </div>\n"],[2103,"      <h1>Sign"],[2103," in</h1>\n     "],[2114," <p class=\"lead muted"],[2124,"\">Welcome back."],[2124," Enter your details to access"],[2135," your workspace.</p>\n   "],[2144," </header>\n\n    <div"],[2154," class=\"card\">\n      "],[2154,"<form id=\"login"],[2164,"-form\" class=\"stack gap"],[2175,"-lg\" novalidate>\n\n"],[2176,"        <div id"],[2183,"=\"form-alert\" class"],[2194,"=\"alert alert-d"],[2194,"estructive\" hidden role=\"alert"],[2203,"\"></div>\n\n        <div"],[2216," class=\"stack gap"],[2228,"-sm\">\n          <label for"],[2229,"=\"email\">\n"],[2234,"            Email address\n            "],[2244,"<input\n              id=\"email"],[2245,"\"\n              name=\"email\"\n"],[2256,"              type=\"email\"\n             "],[2266," inputmode=\"email\"\n             "],[2274," autocomplete=\"username"],[2274,"\"\n              placeholder=\"you@"],[2284,"company.com\"\n              required\n"],[2295,"              aria"],[2295,"-describedby=\"email-help"],[2305,"\">\n         "],[2317," </label>\n          <p"],[2317," id"],[2325,"=\"email-help\" class=\""],[2336,"small muted\">Use"],[2346," the"],[2346," address"],[2355," your"],[2366," invite"],[2366," was sent to.</p>\n"],[2376,"        </div>\n\n        "],[2387,"<div class=\"stack gap-sm"],[2387,"\">\n          <label for=\""],[2396,"password\">\n            Password